### ti-import-worker — direct call, port 8083
# NOT reachable through the gateway: this endpoint lives under /rest/v1/**, and the
# gateway (GatewayController) only proxies /api/v1/**. Call the service directly
# when testing standalone.

### Upload a CSV/Excel file of questions for import
POST http://localhost:8083/rest/v1/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="questions.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

QUESTION,LEVEL,SHORT ANSWER,RESOURCE
How can we make observable applications?,A2,"Observability is the ability to measure the internal state of a system.",https://habr.com/en/companies/otus/articles/1031290/
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### Version check
GET http://localhost:8083/rest/v1/version
Accept: text/plain

